1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,300
Everybody serves a master.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,800
Most people never find out who theirs is —
until money asks them to choose.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,900
Money is a great servant.

4
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:14,400
And a terrible god.

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:18,700
The first question was never
"How much do I have?"

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,600
It's — "Whose is it?"

7
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,600
So there's a code.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,300
OWNERSHIP.

9
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,800
FAITHFULNESS.

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,000
MASTERY.

11
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,100
MULTIPLICATION.

12
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:33,300
Be faithful in the little.

13
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:36,900
Don't bury what He put in your hands.

14
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,600
Christ my Master. Money my servant.

15
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Twenty-six episodes. All of August.

16
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:44,900
Crack the code.
